<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Rent BF | Professional Companionship</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      color: #222;
    }

    header {
      background: #222;
      color: white;
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    nav {
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 12px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 80px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: white;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 18px;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: #222;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 60px 20px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .services {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      width: 240px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    form {
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px;
      margin: 10px 0;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #222;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .rules {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 30px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    footer {
      background: #222;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
    }

    @media(max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h2 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>Rent BF</h1>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#booking">Booking</a>
    <a href="#rules">Rules</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <h2>Professional Companionship</h2>

  <p>
    Social events, outings और बातचीत के लिए
    professional companionship service।
  </p>

  <a href="#booking" class="btn">Book Now</a>
</section>

<section id="services">

  <h2>Our Services</h2>

  <div class="services">

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🤝 Social Companion</h3>
      <p>Social occasions में professional companionship.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🎉 Event Companion</h3>
      <p>Events और functions में साथ जाने के लिए.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🚶 Outing Companion</h3>
      <p>Public outings और घूमने के लिए companionship.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>💬 Conversation</h3>
      <p>बातचीत और social company के लिए.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<section id="booking">

  <h2>Booking Request</h2>

  <form>

    <input type="text" placeholder="आपका नाम" required>

    <input type="tel" placeholder="फोन नंबर" required>

    <input type="date" required>

    <select required>
      <option value="">Service चुनें</option>
      <option>Social Companion</option>
      <option>Event Companion</option>
      <option>Outing Companion</option>
      <option>Conversation</option>
    </select>

    <textarea placeholder="अपनी booking details लिखें"></textarea>

    <button type="submit">Send Booking Request</button>

  </form>

</section>

<section id="rules">

  <h2>Safety & Rules</h2>

  <div class="rules">
    ✅ सभी interactions में दोनों लोगों की स्पष्ट सहमति जरूरी है।<br>
    ✅ केवल कानूनी और professional companionship services उपलब्ध हैं।<br>
    ✅ पहली मुलाकात public जगह पर रखने की सलाह दी जाती है।<br>
    ✅ किसी भी illegal या गैर-सहमति वाली activity की अनुमति नहीं है।<br>
    ✅ सभी clients और companions की safety और privacy महत्वपूर्ण है।
  </div>

</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 Rent BF | Professional Companionship</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>